<title>UK: London exchange say order-driven to start October.</title>
<headline>London exchange say order-driven to start October.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Stock Exchange confirmed on Thursday the introduction of its new order-driven electronic trading service is on target for October 20, 1997.</p>
</text>
